PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  Modal (open/size=sm)          → custom centered modal over a 0.45 scrim (HIG dialog) via `.tsConfirmDialog` —
                                  centered on iOS + macOS, and fully controllable so dismissal is suppressed while
                                  loading (the shared bottom-sheet tsModal cannot suppress its close affordance).
  Button (secondary / danger)   → TSButton(.secondary) for cancel; ConfirmActionButton (token-driven ButtonStyle,
                                  Color.TS.statusDanger / statusWarning) for confirm — reproduces the web amber
                                  override the shared Button has no variant for. Loading → spinner; disabled → dim.
  Input (typed confirmation)    → TSTextField (+ autocorrectionDisabled, .never autocapitalization on iOS).
  Checkbox ("Don't ask again")  → TSCheckbox.
  severityTokens / icons        → ConfirmDialogVariant: octagon/triangle SF Symbols + Color.TS.status{Danger,Warning}
                                  banner bg .opacity(0.1) / border .opacity(0.3) / fg accent (matches web bg/border/fg).
  lib/confirmSilence (localStorage) → ConfirmSilenceStore / UserDefaultsConfirmSilenceStore (namespaced keys).
  i18n                          : zero English literals in runtime code paths; every string is a LocalizedStringKey /
                                  NSLocalizedString key resolved through the per-surface "ConfirmDialog" table
                                  (ConfirmDialog.strings), folded into the master catalog at integration time. The web
                                  source key confirm.silence.checkbox is present verbatim.
  a11y                          : dialog card is `.accessibilityAddTraits(.isModal)` + contain + hint; banner combines
                                  icon(label)+message; scrim is `.accessibilityHidden`; confirm exposes a loading
                                  accessibilityValue; cancel/confirm carry explicit labels + .cancelAction/.defaultAction
                                  keyboard shortcuts (Escape/Return). Dynamic Type via the Font.TS ramp; reduce-motion
                                  honored on the present/dismiss transition.
  telemetry                     : view.opened surface="ConfirmDialog" emitted once on present via
                                  ConfirmDialogModel.open (NOT on the silenced auto-resolve, which never shows); default
                                  OSLog sink, redaction-safe (no title/message/typed/silence key logged).

